Dear lavaan project team,
I would appreciate your help in converting an SEM model defined with EQS in R Laavan.

This is the code produced by EQS:

/TITLE
Model built by EQS 6 for Windows
/SPECIFICATIONS
DATA='...';
VARIABLES=20; CASES=211;
METHOD=ML,ROBUST; ANALYSIS=COVARIANCE; MATRIX=RAW;
/LABELS
V1=V1; V2=V2; V3=V3; V4=V4; V5=V5;
V6=V6; V7=V7; V8=V8; V9=V9; V10=V10;
V11=V11; V12=V12; V13=V13; V14=V14; V15=V15;
V16=V16; V17=V17; V18=V18; V19=V19; V20=V20;
/EQUATIONS
V1= *F1+E1;
V2= *F1+E2;
V3= *F1+E3;
V4= *F1+E4;
V5= 1F2+E5;
V6= *F2+E6;
V7= *F2+E7;
